su name loop be refinery def
su name draft ob text "Write three short sentences about rain." for name mind to name text mind-out be write do
su name speak from ve name draft ob name mind-out to filename "artifacts/say/refinery.wav" be say do
su name listen from ve name speak from filename "artifacts/say/refinery.wav" to name text transcript be hear do
su name report from ve name listen ob name transcript be write do
prah

from name loop be refinery do
